    {
     "id": "pr-l3fi90",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 40,
     "y": 452,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 248,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "拖曳反白幾格，右側面板的字級、行距、粗斜體、文字色、對齊、底色與框線，就只作用在那幾格。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "面板頂端會寫現在套到哪裡——是整張表，還是選取的幾格（連是哪幾格都寫出來），不用自己猜。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "沒反白就是整張表。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "點畫布別的地方取消反白，就回到全表。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
